{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106020","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1410602001:0":{"text":"诸位，尽情用你们的目光谴责这些罪人吧！","source_cn":"诸位，尽情用你们的目光谴责这些罪人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE6C207903678B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410602002:0":{"text":"若不是女王陛下垂怜，这些平民怎能蒙受至高的恩典？","source_cn":"若不是女王陛下垂怜，这些平民怎能蒙受至高的恩典？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BC392C30E83D29B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410602003:0":{"text":"然而，面对稍许风雨扬起的尘沙时，他们竟在其中迷失方向，背弃了仁慈的女王！","source_cn":"然而，面对稍许风雨扬起的尘沙时，他们竟在其中迷失方向，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B120C5E6836BC75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410602004:0":{"text":"这是何等的亵渎，何等的冒犯！在此，我将以女王之名，对所有无可救药之徒降下死亡！","source_cn":"这是何等的亵渎，何等的冒犯！在此，我将以女王之名，对所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26ACFFFDA62ADB8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410602005:1":{"text":"所有……？你该不会是指，在场的所有平民吧？","source_cn":"所有……？你该不会是指，在场的所有平民吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD68BE5D4B9C88D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"",